src/autowan/data/frontier_wannier_lookup.csv.gz
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A table extracted from the AiiDA archives of the following Materials Cloud Archive
records, which are distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
The table was modified: one row per top-level Wannierisation workflow was selected
and a subset of columns extracted (see src/autowan/data/FRONTIER_DATASET.md).

  - Materials Cloud Archive, doi:10.24435/materialscloud:x0-yf (v2 of v4-e9).
    J. Qiao, G. Pizzi, N. Marzari, "Projectability disentanglement for accurate and
    automated electronic-structure Hamiltonians", npj Comput. Mater. 9, 208 (2023),
    arXiv:2303.07877.

  - Materials Cloud Archive, doi:10.24435/materialscloud:ck-br (v2; v1 is
    doi:10.24435/materialscloud:9g-ds).
    Y. Jiang et al., "Robust Wannierization including magnetization and spin-orbit
    coupling via projectability disentanglement", npj Comput. Mater. 11, 353 (2025),
    arXiv:2507.06840.

If you use the frontier_dataset tool or this table, cite the papers and the archive
DOIs above.

